{"id":"421b1aea26ad8bcb","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-ultraproduct-compactness.md","title":"Compactness by Ultraproducts","display":"thm-ultraproduct-compactness — Compactness by Ultraproducts","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-ultraproduct-compactness","aliases":["17-thm-ultraproduct-compactness"],"display":"thm-ultraproduct-compactness — Compactness by Ultraproducts","depends_on":["[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-generated-filter]]","[[17-prop-generated-filter]]","[[17-thm-ultrafilter-extension]]","[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","[[17-thm-los]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"Corollary 4.1.11","source_pages_print":[219,220],"source_pages_djvu":[235,236],"source_verification":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; explicit ultraproduct witness"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-ultraproduct-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-ultraproduct-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ultraproduct-compactness — Compactness by Ultraproducts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5deae0a21cc8b810\" href=\"?note=5deae0a21cc8b810\" title=\"17-df-generated-filter\">17-df-generated-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fce963a0c22b921d\" href=\"?note=fce963a0c22b921d\" title=\"17-prop-generated-filter\">17-prop-generated-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76b41a152803a0c7\" href=\"?note=76b41a152803a0c7\" title=\"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension\">17-thm-ultrafilter-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Corollary 4.1.11"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>219</span><span>220</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>235</span><span>236</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-and-source-proof-compared; explicit ultraproduct witness"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为句子集；模型关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{s\\subseteq T:|s|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(I=\\{s\\subseteq T:|s|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>，并给定结构族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I}\">\\((\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_s\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A_s\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_s\\models s\">\\(\\mathfrak A_s\\models s\\)</span>。超积与超滤子接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ed1712b26584150e\" href=\"?note=ed1712b26584150e\" title=\"17-df-ultraproduct\">17-df-ultraproduct</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76b41a152803a0c7\" href=\"?note=76b41a152803a0c7\" title=\"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension\">17-thm-ultrafilter-extension</a>；Łoś 定理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b51a9d2d7c819846\" href=\"?note=b51a9d2d7c819846\" title=\"17-thm-los\">17-thm-los</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\;\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\land\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\;\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I(U)\n\\land\\operatorname{Ultraproduct}_L((\\mathfrak A_s)_{s\\in I},U,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书推论4.1.11，印刷 pp.219–220（DjVu 235–236），陈述及证明均已核对。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in T\">\\(\\sigma\\in T\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\sigma=\\{s\\in I:\\sigma\\in s\\}\">\\(X_\\sigma=\\{s\\in I:\\sigma\\in s\\}\\)</span>。任意有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\sigma\">\\(X_\\sigma\\)</span> 的交包含由这些句子组成的有限集，因此该族有有限交性质；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fce963a0c22b921d\" href=\"?note=fce963a0c22b921d\" title=\"17-prop-generated-filter\">17-prop-generated-filter</a> 给真生成滤子，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"76b41a152803a0c7\" href=\"?note=76b41a152803a0c7\" title=\"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension\">17-thm-ultrafilter-extension</a> 给含它的超滤子。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\sigma\">\\(X_\\sigma\\)</span> 包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{s:\\mathfrak A_s\\models\\sigma\\}\">\\(\\{s:\\mathfrak A_s\\models\\sigma\\}\\)</span>，所以该真值集合在超滤子中，由 Łoś 定理的句子情形，超积满足每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in T\">\\(\\sigma\\in T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\varnothing\">\\(T=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(I=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，证明仍成立。</p>\n<p>本节点新增的是有限子理论模型族的具体超积实现；已有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"de1a11e45b1a5282\" href=\"?note=de1a11e45b1a5282\" title=\"17-thm-compactness\">17-thm-compactness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"67e164c877491dc2\" href=\"?note=67e164c877491dc2\" title=\"17-thm-compactness-henkin-form\">17-thm-compactness-henkin-form</a> 是紧致性的不同接口，并不指定这些给定模型的超积。搜索本册的 ultraproduct、compactness、超积和紧致性以及现有 MOC 后未找到同一构造性接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-generated-filter","status":"resolved","id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-generated-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-prop-generated-filter","status":"resolved","id":"fce963a0c22b921d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-prop-generated-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-ultrafilter-extension","status":"resolved","id":"76b41a152803a0c7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-ultrafilter-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"ed1712b26584150e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-los","status":"resolved","id":"b51a9d2d7c819846","anchor":"r